WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.904 --> 00:00:21.365
Bobby waved good-bye to his mom and walked inside the school.

2
00:00:25.786 --> 00:00:27.487
It felt a little weird to be there.

3
00:00:29.668 --> 00:00:30.988
He wasn't going to class.

4
00:00:35.596 --> 00:00:37.357
And he wasn't going to Kids Central.

5
00:00:38.418 --> 00:00:40.720
He was going to Kids Central summer camp!

6
00:00:43.361 --> 00:00:46.284
In the gym Bobby saw a bucket of water balloons.

7
00:00:49.846 --> 00:00:54.429
A tall man was wearing a T-shirt that said: "Kids Central Summer Camp."

8
00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.311
He also had on a baseball cap.

9
00:00:58.332 --> 00:01:00.433
"Welcome, camper," the man said.

10
00:01:00.453 --> 00:01:02.635
"Let me guess.

11
00:01:03.716 --> 00:01:08.113
Bobby?" "That's me," Bobby said.

12
00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:11.334
"Are you Mr.

13
00:01:11.414 --> 00:01:16.036
Dunn?" His mom had told him Miss Shelly wouldn't be teaching this summer.

14
00:01:17.056 --> 00:01:18.357
Mr. Dunn smiled.

15
00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:19.898
"That's me.

16
00:01:21.238 --> 00:01:23.759
My friend Miss Shelly told me all about you.

17
00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:28.301
I hear you're on your way to becoming a basketball star."

18
00:01:29.842 --> 00:01:31.342
Bobby tried not to grin.

19
00:01:31.362 --> 00:01:33.863
"Nah," he said.

20
00:01:36.016 --> 00:01:39.539
Suddenly the gym door burst open and two girls rushed in.

21
00:01:39.559 --> 00:01:42.641
"Nina! Izzie!

22
00:01:43.361 --> 00:01:45.282
You guys are here for the summer too?"

23
00:01:45.583 --> 00:01:46.303
Bobby said.

24
00:01:46.323 --> 00:01:49.485
"The whole summer," Izzie said.

25
00:01:49.505 --> 00:01:52.928
"I can't wait," said Nina.

26
00:01:52.948 --> 00:01:55.349
"Even though I'm here already."

27
00:01:55.369 --> 00:01:57.531
The two girls giggled.

28
00:01:58.711 --> 00:02:00.413
Then they looked up at their new teacher.

29
00:02:00.433 --> 00:02:02.154
"Hi, Mr.

30
00:02:02.194 --> 00:02:03.495
Dunn," they said.

31
00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:05.968
"Nice to meet you," Mr.

32
00:02:06.008 --> 00:02:06.669
Dunn said.

33
00:02:06.689 --> 00:02:10.832
"We're just waiting for—" "Jason and Ethan!"

34
00:02:11.212 --> 00:02:12.213
Izzie squealed.

35
00:02:12.233 --> 00:02:14.594
"That's right."

36
00:02:15.175 --> 00:02:16.796
Mr. Dunn looked surprised.

37
00:02:17.997 --> 00:02:21.339
"No. I mean Jason and Ethan are here!"

38
00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:25.382
Izzie pointed as Jason and Ethan walked over to them.

39
00:02:25.402 --> 00:02:30.386
"Great. Jason, Ethan, I'm Mr.

40
00:02:30.406 --> 00:02:33.608
Dunn. Everybody, follow me outside."

41
00:02:35.156 --> 00:02:37.478
Mr. Dunn led them to the blacktop.

42
00:02:38.478 --> 00:02:41.761
"We're going to have a get-to-know-you water balloon toss.

43
00:02:42.801 --> 00:02:44.262
Please get into pairs."

44
00:02:45.203 --> 00:02:47.004
Izzie and Nina paired up first.

45
00:02:48.285 --> 00:02:50.126
Then Jason and Ethan paired up.

46
00:02:52.768 --> 00:02:54.789
"Bobby, will you be my partner?"

47
00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.210
Mr. Dunn asked.

48
00:02:57.031 --> 00:02:58.452
Bobby's face brightened.

49
00:02:58.472 --> 00:03:03.555
"Sure!" "We'll start facing each other," Mr.

50
00:03:03.615 --> 00:03:04.456
Dunn explained.

51
00:03:07.926 --> 00:03:11.127
"One person holds the balloon.

52
00:03:12.108 --> 00:03:15.990
When you toss the balloon, say something you know about your partner.

53
00:03:17.391 --> 00:03:18.051
For example."

54
00:03:19.372 --> 00:03:20.853
Mr. Dunn looked at Bobby.

55
00:03:20.873 --> 00:03:24.975
"Bobby likes basketball!"

56
00:03:25.335 --> 00:03:27.576
he said as he tossed Bobby the water balloon.

57
00:03:28.337 --> 00:03:29.617
Bobby caught it easily.

58
00:03:29.637 --> 00:03:34.120
"When you catch the balloon, take one step back.

59
00:03:35.308 --> 00:03:39.351
Then toss it to your partner and say something about him or her.

60
00:03:40.412 --> 00:03:40.732
Get it?"

61
00:03:41.832 --> 00:03:43.394
Mr. Dunn looked at everyone.

62
00:03:43.414 --> 00:03:44.794
"Got it!"

63
00:03:47.196 --> 00:03:49.097
Izzie held a balloon over her head.

64
00:03:49.117 --> 00:03:52.620
"Be careful, Izzie," Nina said.

65
00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:56.242
"If you burst that balloon, we're out of the game."

66
00:03:56.262 --> 00:03:59.644
"Nina's right," said Mr.

67
00:03:59.684 --> 00:04:04.648
Dunn. "The last pair with a water balloon is the winner."

68
00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.042
The partners lined up facing each other.

69
00:04:09.062 --> 00:04:11.703
"Jason likes to cook!"

70
00:04:12.124 --> 00:04:14.185
Ethan called, tossing the balloon.

71
00:04:14.205 --> 00:04:18.508
"Ethan likes the ocean!"

72
00:04:19.409 --> 00:04:21.310
Jason threw it back to his partner.

73
00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:25.213
"Nina's good at jumping rope," Izzie said.

74
00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:32.838
good at making people laugh," Nina said.

75
00:04:33.778 --> 00:04:35.720
Bobby still hadn't thrown his balloon.

76
00:04:37.784 --> 00:04:39.165
"Uh-oh, Mr.

77
00:04:39.285 --> 00:04:43.207
Dunn. I don't know anything about you," he said.

78
00:04:43.227 --> 00:04:45.749
"Sure, you do," Mr.

79
00:04:45.789 --> 00:04:46.449
Dunn said.

80
00:04:46.469 --> 00:04:52.272
"Think." "You ride your bike to camp!"

81
00:04:52.753 --> 00:04:53.433
Izzie said.

82
00:04:53.453 --> 00:04:55.694
"You like to garden!"

83
00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:56.875
Ethan said.

84
00:04:58.016 --> 00:04:58.976
Bobby smiled.

85
00:04:58.996 --> 00:05:02.178
"You're friends with Miss Shelly!"

86
00:05:02.198 --> 00:05:07.114
The kids cheered.

87
00:05:07.154 --> 00:05:08.987
"This summer is going to be fun!"

88
00:05:09.289 --> 00:05:10.074
Bobby thought.
